# ctrim_app Firebase

- All Firestore reads/writes through `lib/firebase/db_managers/`
- Cloud Functions via `functions_manager.dart`
- `cloud_firestore` types only in `firebase/` and `models/`

Info content: `InfoRepository` (`lib/utility/info_repository.dart`) + `info_db_manager.dart` for churches, testimonials, ctrim_info. `assets/info/` JSON is legacy seed/reference only.

Admin catalogs: `user_tags` / `user_locations` via their DB managers; users store tag IDs and location **names**. Post content tags: `post_tags` via `PostTagDBManager`; posts/templates store `TagIDs`; optional `StreamKind` drives location-aware FCM streams (`docs/post-tags-notification-streams.md`).
